{"id":"8a304812dec1e29f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-projection-function.md","title":"Projection Function $\\pi i^n$","display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function $\\pi_i^n$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projection-function","aliases":["58-df-projection-function","58-df-pi"],"display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function $\\pi_i^n$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projection-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projection-function</span><span>58-df-pi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-function — Projection Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\omega\">\\(n \\in \\omega\\)</span> (元数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i \\in \\omega\">\\(i \\in \\omega\\)</span> (索引，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{x} = \\langle x_0, \\ldots, x_{n-1}\\rangle \\in \\omega^n\">\\(\\vec{x} = \\langle x_0, \\ldots, x_{n-1}\\rangle \\in \\omega^n\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>元组)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span> (projection-function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S\\)</span> (projection-function predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecProjectionFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecProjectionFunction}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land i\\in n\\land \\pi_i^n:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\\land \\forall \\vec{x}\\in\\omega^n\\;(\\pi_i^n(\\vec{x})=x_i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land i\\in n\\land \\pi_i^n:\\omega^n\\to\\omega\\land \\forall \\vec{x}\\in\\omega^n\\;(\\pi_i^n(\\vec{x})=x_i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProjectionFunction}_S(\\pi_i^n,i,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元投影函数，返回第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个分量</li>\n<li>The arity and coordinate index are internal to the assertion; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in n\">\\(i\\in n\\)</span> excludes out-of-range and non-natural indices.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 的基函数之一</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fff5dc780f29d486\" href=\"?note=fff5dc780f29d486\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md\">../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md</a> — zero function</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a> — successor function</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a> — primitive-recursive functions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"fff5dc780f29d486","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"